+
+### .validateSchema(schema, data, [httpPart])
+<a id="validateschema"></a>
+
+Validates `data` against an inline schema at request time and returns `true`
+when the data satisfies the schema. The optional `httpPart` is forwarded to the
+`ValidationCompiler` if provided, defaults to `null`. Unlike
+[.validateInput](#validate), any JSON Schema form is accepted, including the
+boolean schemas `true` and `false`.
+
+```js
+const accepted = request.validateSchema(false, request.body) // false
+```
